## Solution design

Schema-driven header mapping: a configuration sheet with 340+ field definitions and aliases maps differently named or ordered columns to one layout.

## Build

- Data quality checks: normalization of names, dates and codes, validation, duplicate detection and a trace of corrupted rows.
- Monitoring, funneling and recruiter performance reports, plus automatic updates to the weekly Board of Directors PowerPoint deck.
- Later rebuilt as a web application: the FPTK & Sourcing Database.

